# Prerequisites
1. Assumes Zsh is already being used as main shell
2. Expects homebrew to be installed (Linux/Mac)

TODO new simplified system:
- Use native terminal w/ window manager (e.g. Terminal on Windows with WSL2 used by default and iTerm2 on MacOS)
- Download and install nice font, like JetBrains Mono
- Download and install Nvim along with ripgrep
- Use Nvim :term as much as possible when working on a project, but can still open new tabs if needed
- Use fish for shell

